WEBVTT

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.480
He's not here...

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:11.440
<i>I hope he's just busy with his 
research like usual, but if not...</i>

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:13.450
<i>It couldn't be that even Lucien was...</i>

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:17.580
<i>With his Evol out of control, 
Gavin distanced himself from me.</i>

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.760
<i>I've tried calling him over 
and over since then,</i>

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:21.160
<i>but I've been unable to reach him.</i>

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:24.500
<i>And Kiro, after the commotion 
caused by his fans,</i>

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.500
<b>Kiro, an Idol at Peak Fame, Announces Sudden Retirement. 
A Result of His Fans Rioting?</b>

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.540
<b>We'll be waiting!!</b>

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.540
<b>Kiro
I love you</b>

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.540
<b>Give Kiro back!</b>

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.360
<i>suddenly declared his retirement.</i>

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.000
<i>Predictably, I can't reach him, either.</i>

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:30.570
<i>No one knows where Victor has gone.</i>

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:34.430
<i>Even Mr. Goldman and Mr. Mills 
don't know where he is.</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.950
<i>The one thing these four men 
I can't contact have in common</i>

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:39.760
<i>is that they are Evolvers.</i>

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:47.970
Please, everyone...

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:50.020
Please be safe...

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:52.760
<i>But by that time,</i>

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:57.140
<i>an invisible, warped power 
had already engulfed the city.</i>

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:10.260
"It takes all the running you can do, 
to keep in the same place."

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:10.260
~The Red Queen Hypothesis~

00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:12.940
<i>"Queen."</i>

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:14.720
<i>The one who possesses her genes</i>

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:17.340
<i>can bless those who have 
special powers, Evolvers,</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.620
<i>with even greater power, 
clearing a path to the future.</i>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.790
<i>When the Queen truly awakens,</i>

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:26.230
<i>will the world achieve further evolution, or...</i>

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:46.020
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:49.520
"Monochrome"

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:56.860
All this information is from our viewers?

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.610
Yes, it is!

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:00.200
It's been like this since yesterday.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:02.570
Even just verifying it all is a lot of work.

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:05.460
Things like patients complaining 
about negative reactions

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:07.790
after getting X-rays at the Central Hospital...

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:12.510
This one's about the elevator at the 
Starly Tower going out of control.

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:13.520
Out of control...

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:17.220
But there wasn't anything wrong 
with the elevator, right?

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:18.580
Right!

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:20.900
So, since that place used to be a graveyard,

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:22.780
I was wondering if it might be ghosts.

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:24.410
The occult, huh?

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:25.800
As an aside...

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.610
According to my info network,

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:31.050
there are migratory birds in 
this area that shouldn't be here,

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:35.690
and certain spots where smartphone 
and internet connections don't work...

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.500
I don't think that has anything to do with this.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.600
What? Why not?

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:43.460
What do you think about 
this string of incidents?

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:49.240
<i>All the things that have 
happened since yesterday</i>

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:51.860
<i>seem like they have to be 
Evols gone out of control.</i>

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:55.630
President? Where are you going?

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:57.540
Loveland University!

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:04.050
<i>If he's just busy, he should be in his lab.</i>

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:06.340
<i>First, I'll make sure Lucien is safe,</i>

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:08.680
<i>then I'll ask for his opinion 
on the berserk incidents.</i>

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:15.980
That's...

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:17.190
Run!

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:36.630
Everything's all right now.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:37.780
Lucien!

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:44.260
I was worried because I couldn't reach you,

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.260
so I thought I'd go to the university.

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:48.970
I've been busy with research.

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:51.570
I'm sorry. We must have 
ended up missing each other.

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:54.340
I was actually on my way to visit your office.

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:56.900
I heard a lot of inexplicable 
incidents have been happening.

00:04:58.730 --> 00:04:59.560
Does it hurt?

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:01.820
No, not at all.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:05.080
Has something happened?

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:08.450
You don't have to tell me 
if you don't want to,

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:11.950
but if it would help your heart 
feel even a little lighter...

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:13.700
I wish you'd tell me.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:18.080
Everything that's happening...

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:21.210
might all be my fault!

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:24.390
Hurry up!

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:26.480
It's so high!

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:31.800
So this girl said you have the ability 
to awaken and amplify Evols?

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:34.520
I think evolution is necessary.

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:39.650
To create a better future, we need 
to always keep moving forward.

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:43.500
It's because you didn't give in to your 
difficult circumstances and troubles,

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:45.150
because you kept moving forward,

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:49.510
that your company and program survived 
and continue to thrive even now.

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:52.280
Your courage cleared the way to that future.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:54.070
Lucien...

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:57.890
And because of that, you've had 
precious, irreplaceable encounters.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:05:58.870
Right?

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:01.050
Right.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.250
<i>That really is true.</i>

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:05.130
<i>If I'd given up along the way,</i>

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:06.970
<i>I know I wouldn't have met any of them.</i>

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:10.810
Moving forward is not a bad thing.

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:12.970
In fact, it's a wonderful thing.

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:15.180
But because of that, everyone is...

00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:17.740
So many people have been hurt.

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:22.650
The blame for that should fall 
on the ones who were using you.

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:24.400
You haven't done anything wrong.

00:06:25.720 --> 00:06:27.610
Thank you, Lucien.

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:31.980
Now that I know you're safe, 
I feel a lot better.

00:06:31.980 --> 00:06:35.120
I'm sure everyone's worried about me, 
so I'll head back to the office.

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:37.700
You really are a fool.

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:41.580
Do you really think you can deceive 
me with such a transparent lie?

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:42.560
Huh?

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:47.260
I'm not so stupid that I don't 
know what you're trying to do.

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:51.930
The you that I know will keep chasing 
after the truth, regardless of the danger,

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.350
and try to put an end to this situation.

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:55.650
Well, I mean...

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:58.610
I can't just leave things 
this way and do nothing!

00:06:58.610 --> 00:07:01.980
Don't worry. I'll be fine on my own.

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:04.430
But<i> I </i>won't be fine.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.780
I'm worried about you.

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:09.900
I don't want you caught up in this, too.

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:14.410
Then let me ask you this: who is it 
you see in front of you right now?

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:15.690
Huh?

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:19.790
You have the perfect specialist to investigate 
the berserk incidents, right here.

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:22.050
And you're going to just pass that by?

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:25.630
Is that the best decision you 
could make as a journalist?

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:32.220
Will you help me, Lucien?

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:33.680
Of course.

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:37.350
Loveland University

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.390
<i>After that, the two of us</i>

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:42.650
<i>thoroughly reexamined 
all the data from incidents</i>

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:44.900
<i>thought to be caused by berserk Evols.</i>

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:50.610
The locations of the berserk incidents

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:52.860
are concentrated in these few areas.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:58.080
Which means there's something here that 
triggers Evols to go out of control, right?

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:03.900
It isn't visible, but there is definitely 
something exerting an influence on us.

00:08:04.570 --> 00:08:05.730
Electromagnetic waves...

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:06.810
Electromagnetic waves?

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:08.540
Didn't you mention that

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:12.010
certain areas have been experiencing 
service interruptions lately?

00:08:12.610 --> 00:08:14.260
You see? Look.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:19.560
The locations with the most incidents

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:22.220
and the places with the service 
outages are the same!

00:08:22.220 --> 00:08:25.400
Yes. I can't imagine it's simply coincidence.

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:28.640
If some kind of unique electromagnetic 
waves are being transmitted from here,

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:30.850
and they're triggering Evols 
to go out of control

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:34.570
and also interfering with other
 frequencies and geomagnetism...

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:39.550
That would explain the service outages 
and the migratory birds flying off course.

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:40.740
I see.

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:42.290
Then if we investigate this place...

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:45.430
I'm sorry.

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:48.060
You should keep that.

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:50.840
I've been using it for a long 
time as a good luck charm.

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:52.760
I'll give it to you.

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:55.330
I can't accept something so precious to you.

00:08:57.730 --> 00:09:01.680
This carries the name "Iridescent," 
meaning "rainbow-colored."

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:04.640
You're like a rainbow.

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:08.610
I know you can become a brilliant, 
glittering bridge to the future.

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:10.300
I truly believe that.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:15.180
Lucien...

00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:18.780
Thank you. I'll treasure it.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.040
Let's go.

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:30.960
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:35.970
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:39.760
<b>Loveland Station</b>

00:09:36.690 --> 00:09:40.550
If electromagnetic waves are randomly 
triggering Evols to go out of control,

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:43.290
they have to be someplace 
where a lot of people gather.

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:46.940
And it also has to be somewhere 
people won't see them.

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:54.260
Construction here has been stopped 
while they revise the blueprints.

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:57.350
This place does meet all 
the requirements perfectly.

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:02.740
<i>But it was like trying to find 
a needle in a haystack.</i>

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:07.320
Are you all right?

00:10:07.850 --> 00:10:09.930
Yup! I'm totally fine!

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:12.360
After all, all we can do 
is search inch by inch.

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:14.300
Okay! We can do this!

00:10:24.490 --> 00:10:25.620
Is something wrong?

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:29.830
What are you...

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:30.960
Shh!

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:32.770
Shh...

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:42.450
Anything out of the ordinary?

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:46.020
All right. Let's go.

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:55.980
Um, Lucien...

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:57.510
They're gone.

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:00.590
Thanks.

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:03.070
But you kind of surprised me, to be honest.

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:05.540
I saw a vision of someone coming here.

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:07.700
So I panicked and did... <i>that</i>...

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:08.570
"That"?

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:11.520
You know, sort of threw myself at you...

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:14.670
You were very cute back there.

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:16.530
I don't want to see it again, though.

00:11:16.930 --> 00:11:17.730
Huh?

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:23.320
Promise me that when there's danger, 
you'll prioritize your own safety first.

00:11:23.630 --> 00:11:27.540
All right. But I want to keep you safe, too.

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:28.910
You want to protect me?

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:36.170
I need to do something to 
thank you for what you did.

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:37.920
Think about what you'd like.

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:40.340
Oh, you don't need to do anything...

00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:47.760
This seems to be a receiver.

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:49.370
A receiver?

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:53.100
It's likely that more of them 
are set up in other places.

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:55.840
They receive the broadcast 
electromagnetic waves

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:57.320
and scatter them.

00:11:57.320 --> 00:12:02.390
You mean these devices don't 
create electromagnetic waves,

00:12:02.390 --> 00:12:05.140
but the electromagnetic 
waves that trigger Evols

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:07.800
to go out of control originate elsewhere?

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:09.120
Exactly.

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:12.830
The center of the area where 
the incidents are concentrated...

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:15.260
A place that could transmit

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:17.950
electromagnetic waves strong enough
 to cover an area this broad...

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:22.400
Loveland TV Tower.

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:28.190
The tallest structure in the city,
standing at its center.

00:12:28.190 --> 00:12:31.680
It's probably safe to assume that it's 
the source of the triggering waves.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:32.810
In that case...

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:34.510
Where are you going?

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:35.870
Loveland TV Tower!

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:39.780
Stopping the waves at their source will be 
the quickest and most certain route, right?

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:41.580
That is true.

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:45.250
But this isn't something that can be 
solved by recklessly marching straight in.

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:55.000
Still, I have to find a way to stop them.

00:12:55.700 --> 00:13:00.650
I can't let them take away the hope of a future 
where children like them can play freely.

00:13:01.110 --> 00:13:02.490
Flying kites...

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:04.830
I loved doing that when I was little.

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:08.010
The kite looked so free, dancing in the sky...

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:09.440
I've never done it.

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:11.100
What? Not even once?

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:17.610
In that case, once this is all wrapped up, 
want to fly kites together?

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:23.400
When we do, will you 
teach me how to fly a kite?

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:24.880
Of course!

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:26.360
It's a promise.

00:13:38.530 --> 00:13:40.630
My kite!

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.630
It flew away!

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:46.580
It's those men from earlier.

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:48.490
We need to get away from here.

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:03.900
An Evolver...

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:05.170
Run, Lucien!

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:07.570
It's me they're after! So you should...

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:36.190
Lost sight of 'em.

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:39.900
Don't panic. They haven't left the park yet.

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:44.860
They took a receiver. 
We can't let them get away.

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:46.660
We <i>will </i>capture them!

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:53.100
Lucien... At this rate, it's only a 
matter of time before they find us...

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:54.620
Quiet. Stay still.

00:14:56.050 --> 00:14:59.320
<i>But if we stay here,
you'll be in danger, too.</i>

00:15:02.530 --> 00:15:03.880
Lucien, I'm sorry.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:06.130
Make sure you stop the 
electromagnetic waves.

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:07.340
I'm leaving it to you!

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:09.760
I'm over here!

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:11.160
Over there!

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:12.140
After her!

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:36.490
You head around that way.

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:37.580
Got it!

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:51.550
You're really trying to protect me?

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:54.010
Just how far will you...

00:15:57.660 --> 00:15:58.970
You really are...

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:02.580
a fool.

00:16:17.110 --> 00:16:20.540
If you don't want to get hurt, 
don't move from that spot.

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:24.750
Let go!

00:16:25.230 --> 00:16:26.940
Let go of me, you—

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:28.320
Settle down!

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:28.320
Ow!

00:16:28.640 --> 00:16:30.850
The great and mighty Queen...

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:34.230
We don't wish to cause you harm.

00:16:34.230 --> 00:16:39.730
However, if you interfere with the great 
Hades's plan, that's a different story.

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:41.000
Hades?

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.810
So this is one of Black Swan's plots?!

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:46.670
Transmitting those triggering 
waves from Loveland TV Tower,

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:48.690
leaving those receivers 
all over the place...

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:53.900
It's all for the sake of the new world that 
awaits the Evolvers after evolution.

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:20.430
There's no point.

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:24.460
It's not as though you don't know who I am.

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:28.950
Whoever interferes with the plan,

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:32.240
no matter who it is, must be stopped.

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:36.010
Even if it happens to be you,

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:37.620
Ares!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:40.450
What?

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:43.610
In that case, I will restrain the Queen.

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:45.410
You will withdraw.

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:49.880
We can't afford to lose her yet, can we?

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:53.670
For Hades, the Queen must be 
a necessary pawn in the plan.

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:09.930
What's going on?

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:13.170
Who is Ares?

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:17.000
Lucien, are you...

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:21.920
Are you... part of Black Swan?

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:27.120
No, I'm not.

00:18:28.150 --> 00:18:30.330
If I said that, would you believe me?

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:35.440
<i>Trust your instincts.</i>

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:36.820
<i>Show me your color.</i>

00:18:36.820 --> 00:18:38.780
<i>The lower the chances of something are,</i>

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:40.850
<i>the more likely people are 
to feel it was fate. Right?</i>

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:43.040
<i>But </i>I <i>won't be fine.</i>

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:48.020
It was... all lies?

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:53.190
I have a policy never to engage 
in anything pointless.

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:56.920
I told you, didn't I? Humanity must evolve.

00:18:56.920 --> 00:19:01.410
"It takes all the running you can do, 
to keep in the same place."

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:05.680
Evolution is the only way 
to create a better future.

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:08.450
To that end, I will not 
shy away from any means.

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:09.710
Stay back!

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:17.380
Let me go.

00:19:18.350 --> 00:19:22.340
Do you think that here, in this moment, 
you have room to negotiate?

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:26.430
You haven't done anything 
to thank me for earlier yet!

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:29.030
I see.

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:30.880
I will let you go.

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:34.400
However, there is no next time.

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:38.840
You must make sure I never catch you again.

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:49.910
Ares! I don't believe you!

00:19:52.350 --> 00:19:55.380
Because you're not Lucien!

00:19:57.070 --> 00:20:03.280
Lucien would never... do anything to hurt me!

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:18.690
The jar that held the butterfly has broken.

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:26.210
The next time I see you, it will be as Ares.

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:31.390
<i>That's right.</i>

00:20:31.390 --> 00:20:34.240
<i>There are still things I have to do.</i>

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:35.630
<i>Don't cry!</i>

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:47.930
Oh?

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:50.360
So Ares has failed.

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:57.620
And he had been taking such pains to raise 
the Queen in some tepid greenhouse...

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:04.550
With the true Queen's great guidance,

00:21:04.550 --> 00:21:07.810
the fate of this world 
has already been decided.

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:11.420
No one can change the ending.

00:22:52.880 --> 00:22:54.940
<i>What is all this?</i>

00:22:56.600 --> 00:23:00.200
<i>My Evol went wild, twisting space 
and time, and I was thrown here...</i>

00:23:00.590 --> 00:23:03.180
<i>It was on a level incomparable 
to anything previous.</i>

00:23:03.690 --> 00:23:07.580
<i>Could it be that the entrance to a 
wormhole opened in that moment?</i>

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:18.910
Loveland 
Super 
Expo
 2030

00:23:21.120 --> 00:23:23.670
<i>That smile has saved me so many times.</i>

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:26.620
<i>To think it would disappear from my sight...</i>

00:23:26.620 --> 00:23:30.380
<i>One day, I'll fulfill that sweet 
promise I made with you!</i>

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:31.840
<i>Episode ten,</i>

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:33.380
<i>"Dawn of Farewell."</i>

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:34.930
"Dawn of Farewell"
